A||||12||skitime||My car is almost ready for Carlisle,  What do you think?||||1||
Z||000000||skitime||05-15-2001||10:56 AM||||Let me know what you think.  This has been my project since Christmas. Still not done but almost ready for Carlisle. I want to thank several people besides all those on the forum who helped me decide how and what to do to the car.  Thanks to Chris Moore for handling the sale of the car to me. Thanks to Chris Pondski who was a tremendous help in getting parts for me. Pondski is a real asset to the Fiero community. Rockcrawl for the Mecham side scoops, Lawrence for the front spoiler idea. Rodney Dickman for "stuff". Gmpartsdirect.com. Fleabitdog for all his help. Veronica V6 GT for putting up with me living in the garage.  My daughters, Heather and Heidi, for putting up with a Fiero obsessed dad. (We now have three Fieros and running out of parking space for their cars) The car will probably never be "done" but that is because I always come up with ideas some people think are crazy.  Thanks to everyone else that I am surely leaving out.  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P5130025-1.jpg">  <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P5130023-1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P5130017-1.jpg"> <BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P5130012-1.jpg"> <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/P4020014-1.jpg">  <P><p>[This message has been edited by skitime (edited 05-15-2001).]||||reg||1
