Z||000010||skitime||05-15-2001||07:35 PM||||Thanks guys & Lisa,  The color is the original color.  I got the Mecham scoop from forum member Rockcrawl. The Mecham scoops are of the original plastic material and Rockcrawl made molds from these so if you want fiberglass ones he can make them. <BR>The front spoiler I made myself. I got the idea from forum member Lawrence. It is made from another GT front nose. I cut off the bottom of the old nose, turned it upside down, put the reflector pockets from an old rear GT bumper to house small driving lights.  The lights are made by Eagle Eye. The cool part about the bumper is that it is a exact match to the nose and that is made of plastic instead of fiberglass.  If it gets bumped it will not break like all the fiberglass chin spoilers.  ||||reg||1
Z||000011||Veronica's V6 GT||05-16-2001||10:37 PM||||Congratulations, you got it together just in time for Carlisle.  It's looking real good and it's not finished yet. Your car looks so nice those trophies are going to be harder for me to come by. There have been alot of hours spent on this car with many more to come especially when that he finds that 3800 or 4.9 to put in it. We're looking forward to this weekend and meeting as many forum people as we can. <P>Veronica <P>------------------<BR><UL TYPE=SQUARE><BR><LI>88 GT<BR></UL><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Vonnies.jpg"> ||||reg||1
